lt terrain, and each creature standing on the ice must succeed at their choice of a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check against your spell DC or fall @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}. Creatures using an action to move onto the ice during the spell's duration must also attempt their choice of either a Reflex save or an Acrobatics check to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.M76ycLAqHoAgbcej]{Balance}. A creature that ends its turn standing on the ice takes 8 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the cold damage that creatures take from the initial casting by 1d6 and the cold damage they take from ending their turn in the ice by 2.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":4},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"value":20,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":true},"damage":{"JFFYdf7hdJpytbXU":{"formula":"4d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"JFFYdf7hdJpytbXU":"1d6"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/water/snowflake-ice-purple.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.Item.FTjpdbJKibOcgZPN","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"wU9CQg8HemJt6Tr4"},{"type":"spell","name":"Falling Icicles","folder":"uEFGbfMYBJKWBi3Y","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You conjure a cluster of sharpened icicles in the air before letting them fall. All creatures in the area take 1d6 piercing damage and 1d6 cold damage, with a basic Reflex save. Creatures that fail the saving throw are frozen 2.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 piercing and 1d6 cold.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":{"value":10,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"piercing","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false},"kKngICg8mNDFJORD":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":4,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":"1d6","kKngICg8mNDFJORD":"1d6"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/water/projectile-ice-chunks-salvo.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.Item.JCQxDEB0CFIoveu6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"povB4wC9UtyIvz9Z"},{"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/enthrall.webp","name":"Enthrall","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Your words fascinate your targets. You speak or sing without interruption throughout the casting and duration. Targets who notice your speech or song might give their undivided attention; each target must attempt a Will save. The GM might grant a circumstance bonus (to a maximum of +4) if the target is of an opposing religion, ancestry, or political leaning, or is otherwise unlikely to agree with what you're saying.</p>\n<p>Each creature that comes within range has to attempt a save when you Sustain the spell. If you're speaking, enthrall gains the linguistic trait.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected and notices that you tried to use magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target needn't pay attention but doesn't notice you tried to use magic (it might notice others are enthralled).</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} with you. It can attempt another Will save if it witnesses actions or speech with which it disagrees. If it succeeds, it's no longer fascinated and is temporarily immune for 1 hour. If the target is subject to a hostile act, or if another creature succeeds at a Diplomacy or Intimidation check against it, the fascination ends immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target can't attempt a save to end the fascination if it disagrees with you.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"enthrall","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","emotion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"all creatures in range"},"range":{"value":"1200 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":3,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.IihxWhRfpsBgQ5jS","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"XNR6N9vUSbToyVgK"},{"type":"spell","name":"Falling Icicles","folder":"uEFGbfMYBJKWBi3Y","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You conjure a cluster of sharpened icicles in the air before letting them fall. All creatures in the area take 1d6 piercing damage and 1d6 cold damage, with a basic Reflex save. Creatures that fail the saving throw are frozen 2.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 piercing and 1d6 cold.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":{"value":10,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"piercing","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false},"kKngICg8mNDFJORD":{"formula":"1d6","kinds":["damage"],"type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":3,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"9elpZtfJyLNTLC3s":"1d6","kKngICg8mNDFJORD":"1d6"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/water/projectile-ice-chunks-salvo.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.Item.JCQxDEB0CFIoveu6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"wggmGNlqpUB7noDO"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/endure-elements.webp","name":"Environmental Endurance (Cold Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You shield the target against dangerous temperatures. Choose severe cold or heat. The target is protected from the temperature you chose (but not extreme cold or heat).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The target is protected from severe cold and severe heat.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The target is protected from severe cold, severe heat, extreme cold, and extreme heat.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"environmental-endurance","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":2,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.5esP2GVzvxWsMgaX","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"CHE7NxTuolntFgce"},{"folder":"T8AzYUgNIAgTJ9Iz","img":"icons/commodities/materials/feather-damaged-brown.webp","name":"Gentle Landing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> a creature within range is falling</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You raise a magical updraft to arrest a fall. The target's fall slows to 60 feet per round, and the portion of the fall during the spell's duration doesn't count when calculating falling damage. If the target reaches the ground while the spell is in effect, it takes no damage from the fall. The spell ends as soon as the target lands.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"gentle-landing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["air","concentrate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 falling creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"reaction"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz","heightenedLevel":1,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.TTwOKGqmZeKSyNMH","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"AVfcUDYIm9HcseWe"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"icons/magic/movement/trail-streak-impact-blue.webp","name":"Frostbite","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.DdqWMj7cuf4S1bgr]{Spell Effect: Frostbite}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"frostbite","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"cold"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.IxhGEKl63R4QBvkj","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"eeSxNUO5CK9ugRhW"},{"folder":"D7UVaOiB40wTR6kv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an orb of light that sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) in a color you choose. If you create the light in the same space as a willing creature, you can attach the light to the creature, causing it to float near that creature as it moves. You can Sustain the spell to move the light up to 60 feet; you can attach or detach it from a creature as part of this movement.</p>\n<p>You can Dismiss the spell. If you Cast the Spell while you already have four <em>light</em> spells active, you must choose one of the existing spells to end.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The orb sheds light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"light","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until your next daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"M8gu8tYEslObH6vp"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/creatures/mammals/ox-buffalo-horned-green.webp","name":"Speak with Animals (Constant)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals. The spell doesn't make them more friendly than normal. Cunning animals are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"speak-with-animals","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 hour","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"o6EjzWTbxrWeFtXz"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.BBvV7qoXGdw09q1C","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"CS3v1doq6wCbsc1p"},{"type":"action","name":"Snow Vision","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Snow doesn't impair the chionad's vision; they ignore concealment from snowfall.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"OZYYw3DVMKnj8ie3","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Beacon Song","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The chionad's @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.IihxWhRfpsBgQ5jS] innate spell has a range of 1,200 feet. For every 120 feet beyond the initial 120 feet, the save DC decreases by 2.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"zpGQuOLl4A4yIpyx","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Mountain Dependent","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A chionad is mystically bonded to a single cold peak. If they descend below the snow line or fly more than 300 feet from the mountain, they become @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}, increasing the value by 1 for each missed day and reducing by 1 only when they ascend above the snowline. A chionad can perform a 24-hour ritual to bond to a new location.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"a2cDbdvtg4LNjzAR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Radiant Burst","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A creature that takes damage from a northern light Strike must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:26] save or be @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round (or @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light","primal","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"pQP3hfStN6Gh6QfP","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Icicle","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","finesse","magical"]},"damageRolls":{"isn5pYsxIoamZUTo":{"damage":"2d8","damageType":"piercing","category":null},"Ig2HrJwMwGawDppQ":{"damage":"2d6","damageType":"cold","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":16},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"GVFkS5YseRkPkLT5","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Northern Light","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cold","magical","range-increment-60"]},"damageRolls":{"I95v7IjMOvPf9yGc":{"damage":"4d6","damageType":"cold","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":16},"attackEffects":{"value":["radiant-burst"]}},"_id":"jS479gj7G4YOJKq4","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Aurora","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The chionad transforms into a wall of shimmering green, blue and violet light that is 10 feet high and up to 20 feet long. These squares do not need to be in a straight line, but the aurora can't manifest into occupied squares. While in aurora form, the chionad gains resistance 8 to physical damage and is immune to precision damage. They can't cast spells, activate items, or use actions that have the attack or manipulate trait. The aurora sheds dim light in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:20]. Creatures, objects, and magic can pass through the aurora. Foes that pass through the aurora take @Damage[4d8[cold]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:26|basic]). The aurora provides concealment on attacks from the chionad's foes that pass through it, but does not hinder the attacks of the chionad's allies. The chionad remains in aurora form until they Dismiss this effect, after which they can't transform into an aurora again for 1 hour.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","light","manipulate","polymorph","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"s0z3VGIyPKZJHbRS","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,